%% PPTX Subagent System — Workflow Diagram (LINEAR / simplest view)
%% Single vertical pipeline, no lanes — a new reader sees the flow in ~10 seconds.
%% For responsibility lanes see workflow-diagram.mmd; for the full mechanism see
%% workflow-diagram-detailed.mmd.
%% Render at https://mermaid.live
flowchart TD
    A([User requests a deck + optional template]) --> B[Understand request + introspect template]
    B --> C[Generate outline]
    C --> D{Interactive?}
    D -->|Primary agent| E[User confirms outline + density + sign-off]
    D -->|Headless subagent| F[Auto self-critique + standard mode]
    E --> G[Author JSON + webfetch chart data + validate]
    F --> G
    G --> H{Template serves every slide?}
    H -->|Missing layout| I[Clone extended layout → template_new.pptx]
    H -->|Yes| J[Fill template layouts → native .pptx]
    I --> J
    J --> K([Return .pptx path to user])
